यहाँ पर **सभी प्रकार के Prepositions** की एक **विस्तृत सूची और उनके उपयोग (Uses)** दिए गए हैं — जो SSC, RRB, और अन्य प्रतियोगी परीक्षाओं के लिए उपयोगी हैं।

---

## 📘 **1. Prepositions of Time (समय के लिए)**

| Preposition   | Use (प्रयोग)           | Example                              |
| ------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| **at**        | निश्चित समय            | I will meet you **at** 5 PM.         |
| **on**        | दिन, तारीख             | She was born **on** Monday.          |
| **in**        | महीना, साल, अवधि       | He came **in** December.             |
| **since**     | प्रारंभ बिंदु से अब तक | She has been here **since** 2020.    |
| **for**       | अवधि के लिए            | I stayed there **for** two days.     |
| **before**    | किसी चीज़ से पहले      | I will finish it **before** evening. |
| **after**     | किसी चीज़ के बाद       | We will go **after** lunch.          |
| **by**        | निश्चित समय तक         | The train will arrive **by** 6 PM.   |
| **during**    | किसी घटना की अवधि में  | It rained **during** the night.      |
| **from...to** | शुरू से अंत तक         | The office is open **from 9 to 5**.  |

---

## 📘 **2. Prepositions of Place/Position (स्थान या स्थिति)**

| Preposition           | Use (प्रयोग)       | Example                                                |
| --------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| **in**                | अंदर               | He is **in** the room.                                 |
| **on**                | ऊपर (संपर्क में)   | The book is **on** the table.                          |
| **at**                | किसी बिंदु पर      | She is **at** the door.                                |
| **under**             | नीचे               | The cat is **under** the table.                        |
| **over**              | ऊपर (संपर्क नहीं)  | The fan is **over** our heads.                         |
| **above**             | ऊपर (किसी स्तर से) | The picture is **above** the bed.                      |
| **below**             | नीचे (स्तर से)     | His marks are **below** average.                       |
| **behind**            | पीछे               | He is hiding **behind** the curtain.                   |
| **in front of**       | सामने              | The car is **in front of** the house.                  |
| **between**           | दो के बीच          | The ball is **between** two boxes.                     |
| **among**             | तीन या अधिक के बीच | He is **among** friends.                               |
| **near** / **beside** | पास में / बगल में  | He lives **near** the school. / She sat **beside** me. |

---

## 📘 **3. Prepositions of Direction/Motion (दिशा/गति)**

| Preposition | Use (प्रयोग)      | Example                                  |
| ----------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| **to**      | दिशा की ओर        | He is going **to** the market.           |
| **into**    | अंदर की ओर        | She went **into** the room.              |
| **onto**    | ऊपर की ओर         | The cat jumped **onto** the table.       |
| **off**     | नीचे की ओर        | He fell **off** the bike.                |
| **out of**  | बाहर की ओर        | She came **out of** the house.           |
| **towards** | की ओर             | He walked **towards** the gate.          |
| **through** | आर-पार            | The train passed **through** the tunnel. |
| **along**   | के साथ-साथ        | He walked **along** the river.           |
| **across**  | आर-पार (पार करना) | She ran **across** the road.             |

---

## 📘 **4. Prepositions of Cause/Reason/Purpose (कारण / उद्देश्य)**

| Preposition    | Use (प्रयोग) | Example                                    |
| -------------- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------ |
| **because of** | कारण         | The match was delayed **because of** rain. |
| **due to**     | कारण         | The flight was cancelled **due to** fog.   |
| **for**        | उद्देश्य     | This gift is **for** you.                  |
| **from**       | स्रोत        | She suffers **from** fever.                |

---

## 📘 **5. Prepositions of Instrument/Agent (साधन/कारक)**

| Preposition | Use (प्रयोग)                    | Example                          |
| ----------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------- |
| **by**      | क्रिया का कर्ता (passive voice) | The book was written **by** him. |
| **with**    | उपकरण                           | He cut it **with** a knife.      |

---

## 📘 **6. Prepositions of Manner (तरीका/रूप)**

| Preposition | Use (प्रयोग) | Example                        |
| ----------- | ------------ | ------------------------------ |
| **with**    | तरीके से     | She spoke **with** confidence. |
| **like**    | समानता       | He runs **like** a cheetah.    |
| **in**      | अवस्था       | He arrived **in** anger.       |

---

## 📘 **7. Prepositional Phrases (Preposition + Noun)**

| Phrase           | Example                              |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| **according to** | According to the news, it will rain. |
| **in spite of**  | In spite of pain, he played.         |
| **due to**       | The delay was **due to** rain.       |
| **because of**   | I was late **because of** traffic.   |
| **out of**       | He jumped **out of** the window.     |
| **on behalf of** | I speak **on behalf of** my team.    |

---

## ✅ **Tips to Remember:**

* "at" = बिंदु पर
* "on" = सतह पर
* "in" = अंदर
* "to" = की ओर
* "by" = माध्यम से / द्वारा
* "with" = किसी वस्तु के प्रयोग से

